Z||000004||theogre||09-17-2001||07:21 PM||||I stopped using drive thru more than 10 years ago becuase of this crap. It's not a new problem. My GF still insists on using them and regularly gets stiffed on something. The stores don't give a flying turd. They know most people don't have time to do anythign about it.||||reg||1
Z||000005||stimpy||09-17-2001||07:29 PM||||I can't remember the last time they got the order right for me.  I'm almost to the point of saying "Just give me $4 worth of food. It don't matter what I want, cuz I ain't gonna get it!"||||reg||1
Z||000006||Urchin||09-17-2001||07:47 PM||||Funny you mentioned that.  Just yesterday I got ripped off for a fry and sweet and sour sauce after ordering two combos.  I made the mistake of not checking before I left (which I normally do).  This was the third time in recent trips.  I called and complained and got two free combos out of it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/final.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
