Z||000020||DJRice||09-18-2001||09:37 PM||||I got fed up with my local Hardy's (which I believe, by the way, employs those  who cant cut it at McD or BK) one afternoon several years ago and when the girl behind the counter asked me what kind of soft drink I wanted, I replied:<BR>"What difference does it make?"<BR>To which she responded with a dumbfounded look and then said:<BR>"I dont understand..."<BR>"What difference does it make what kind of a drink I want?  I will tell you Sprite and I am relatively certain I wont get it on the first go around so I figure why waste the effort making a decision.  Just put a beverage in the cup." I said sharply.<BR>Of course, she asked again what I wanted to drink, after I just mentioned my taste for Sprite at the time.<P>I finally just quit going in the place because they opened up a new BK in town.  That place changed my opinion of Hardy's they did not thaw out a beef patty until someone ordered a burger.  And you can forget about "My Way", and that Honey Mustard for your Chicken Tenders will run you an extra .15.<P>Now I just go to Subway or the Publix Deli.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/djr_signature.jpg"> ||||reg||1
